      <activity id="4cabf038-337b-57aa-8f6e-93e4463505ee" activityNameId="3c255ca1-3c57-50fd-9811-f0080a2b2125" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Magnesium oxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Magnesium oxide, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of magnesium oxide. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 001309-48-4; 
Formula: MgO; 
UUID: f07e90df-b4b3-3b77-bd62-6298aea91d2f
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data are used here as European average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from iron mining and benefication as well as lime crushing and milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: worldwide 10.1 Mt in 1989
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f07e90df-b4b3-3b77-bd62-6298aea91d2f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
